      "content": "got it. so it's more about managing the stimulus than just taking a break. i've had clients get really frustrated during those periods though, like they feel like they're losing their edge or that something is \"stealing\" their progress because they can't hit their usual numbers even when they feel rested. from a coaching perspective, how do you explain that feeling of stagnation to them so they don't get discouraged and quit the program?",
